  m_text: "4 Monopoly covering the entire 1st reel convert themselves \nand the other
    Monopoly into Golden Monopoly which provide \na 2x multiplier.\nGolden Monopoly
    multiplier only multiplies each pay-line win.\nKeep in mind that if none of those
    4 symbols are hit, there will \nbe no conversions so you can spin fast."
